    "lyrics": {
      "text": "As the treas--ur-y of our res-ur-rec-tion, O all-hymned one, do thou lead forth from the pit and a-byss of of-fen-ces them that hope in thee; for those__ that were guilt--y be-cause of sin hast thou saved by giv-ing birth to Sal-va--tion, O thou who be-fore__ child-birth wast vir-gin, and in child-birth wast vir-gin, and af-ter child-birth a-gain re-main-est vir--gin.____"
